# Coding Platform - HackerRank Clone

## Environment Variables
JUDGE0_URL=http://65.0.29.135:2358
JUDGE0_TOKEN=your_judge0_token_here

## Google OAuth (get from https://console.cloud.google.com)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret

## NextAuth
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=generate_a_random_secret_here

## Database
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

## Public base URL — invite links are built from this.
## Change it at deploy time so links point at your real host.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
